quiz.question:
次の SCP を Prod の OU に付ける。各文が何を防ぐかを説明し、例外にしたロールに関して必要な追加の守りと、付ける前に確かめることを述べてください(200〜400 字)。

```json
{
  "Statement": [
    { "Sid": "DenyLongTermCredentials", "Effect": "Deny", "Action": ["iam:CreateUser", "iam:CreateAccessKey"], "Resource": "*" },
    { "Sid": "ProtectDataKeys", "Effect": "Deny", "Action": ["kms:PutKeyPolicy", "kms:DisableKey", "kms:ScheduleKeyDeletion"], "Resource": "*",
      "Condition": { "ArnNotLike": { "aws:PrincipalArn": "arn:aws:iam::*:role/KeyAdmin" } } },
    { "Sid": "DenySnapshotSharing", "Effect": "Deny", "Action": ["rds:ModifyDBSnapshotAttribute", "ec2:ModifySnapshotAttribute"], "Resource": "*",
      "Condition": { "ArnNotLike": { "aws:PrincipalArn": "arn:aws:iam::*:role/BackupCopyRole" } } }
  ]
}
```
